  "id": "korean-victini-bwr-battle-promo-card-pack",
  "name": "Korean Victini BWR Battle participation prize",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The participation prize of the Victini BWR Battle, eight-player Black Bolt and White Flare tournaments held at Pokémon Card Shops and official partner shops from 9 August to 21 September 2025, open to anyone who bought one Black Bolt or White Flare pack. Each player received a Victini BWR Battle promo card pack with one of eight trainer cards (186/SV-P to 193/SV-P, from Potion to Cheren) and four random basic Energy cards with the event logo (194/SV-P to 201/SV-P); the pack's trainers were legal in the event's own deck format."
